<title>USA: Control Chief employees to buy UK unit.</title>
<headline>Control Chief employees to buy UK unit.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD, Pa. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Chief Holdings Inc said Monday it has reached an agreement in which its employees would buy out the company's United Kingdom subsidiary, Control Chief UK.</p>
<p>Terms of the financial deal, which is effective today, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In making the announcement, Douglas Bell, chairman and president of the U.S. company, said Control Chief UK will remain a distributor of the company's products.</p>
</text>
